  "solution": {
    "brief": "Wasp example 20: field-driven series continued",
    "principle": "\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 21 (wasp_21) advances into a new topic series beyond tutorial 20, indicating that tutorial 20 is the culmination of the field-driven series (tutorials 16–20). Tutorial 20 is a direct prerequisite for tutorial 21, but tutorial 21 introduces new topics distinct from field-driven aggregation.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 22 (wasp_22) further confirms that tutorial 20 is the culmination of the field-driven series, as the new series (part-based, file-io, multi-part) continues through tutorials 21 and 22 with entirely distinct topics.\n\nRelated insight: Related insight: Tutorial 23 (wasp_23) continues the new topic series through at least tutorial 23, further confirming that tutorial 20 is the culmination of the field-driven series and that the new series (part-based, multi-part, rule-based) extends well beyond tutorial 21.",
