          ]
        },
        {
          "step": "5",
          "title": "PLANE CONSTRAINT",
          "text": "PLANE CONSTRAINT\r\nA Plane Constraint is used to prevent\r\nthe aggregation from growing below\r\nthe XY plane.\r\n\r\nNB: for more info on Constraints, see\r\nthe relative example section.",
